      "title": "A350-900 Delta Air Lines MSN755 Milan 26 special livery roll-out 058 (Delta press image; evidence only)",
      "accessed": "2026-11-12",
      "note": "Right side, nose: the red lower forward sweep, the navy belly line, 'DELTA', 'OFFICIAL AIRLINE OF TEAM USA', flags and the Olympic and Paralympic marks."
